    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just gone. i was looking at my old recordings today and i realized... i’m not that person anymore. it feels like i’ve hit a wall that isn't just a slump, it's the end. if i keep going, i'm just going to be a ghost of myself, making mediocre shit just to stay relevant. i'd rather stop now while I'm still 'something' than live to see myself become a joke.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
