      "content": "Feeling like your core meaning is gone can make everything feel pointless and inert, which is an exhausting place to be. When the driving inspiration seems to have vanished, the focus shifts from the external output to your internal needs for dignity and peace. Before concluding that full cessation is the only dignified path, could you seek support to explore that deep sense of meaninglessness? Talking with a professional can provide compassionate space to navigate the weight of these existential questions.",
